    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Sector 7, the digital underbelly of the Neon Syndicate. The corporate overlords have locked down the main network, trapping vital information behind layers of biometric firewalls and quantum encryption algorithms. You are a rogue netrunner, and you've managed to slip into this abandoned corporate server room undetected. However, the system's automated purge protocols have been activated, and time is rapidly running out. Your objective is clear: navigate this maze of disconnected hardware, reactivate the dormant digital nodes, and bypass their intricate security measures. The syndicate relies on a complex web of mathematical ciphers and hidden cryptographic keys scattered throughout the room. By carefully linking these devices, you must systematically dismantle their defenses. Your ultimate goal is to breach the central mainframe and obtain the core timezone data before the physical servers are fried. Plug in, stay sharp, and don't let the neon lights distract you. The run starts now.",
